<BaseLayout title="Privacy"><div class="wrap static-page"><span class="eyebrow">Respect for readers</span><h1>Privacy, by design.</h1><div class="prose"><p>The public site is a static educational website. It has no visitor accounts, newsletter subscriptions or contact form, and the public browsing experience does not use site-integrated analytics or advertising trackers. The application does not intentionally set cookies for public browsing.</p><p>The protected Admin area uses Cloudflare Access for administrator sign-in. Cloudflare Access may set authentication cookies for that purpose. These are access-control cookies, not advertising or analytics cookies. Our hosting provider may also process ordinary request information, such as IP addresses, for security and content delivery.</p><p>If future versions add visitor-facing forms, analytics or accounts, we will revise this notice before enabling those features. This notice describes the current public site and protected Admin setup and should be reviewed whenever the deployed configuration changes.</p></div></div></BaseLayout>
